  "html": "<html lang=\"zh-CN\" data-theme=\"system\" style=\"color-scheme: light dark;\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>MCP Gateway</title>  <script type=\"module\" crossorigin=\"\" src=\"./assets/index-B-cmGWvb.js\"></script>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" crossorigin=\"\" href=\"./assets/index-DfwTQvN8.css\">\n</head><body><div id=\"app\" data-v-app=\"\"><div class=\"app-shell\"><nav class=\"sidebar\" aria-label=\"应用导航\"><div class=\"brand\"><span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">m</span><span>MCP Gateway<small>个人工作区</small></span></div><div class=\"nav-caption\">工作区</div><button class=\"nav-button\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"nav-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">▤</span>MCP 服务<span class=\"count\">1</span></button><button class=\"nav-button\"><span class=\"nav-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⌘</span>工具<!----></button><button class=\"nav-button\"><span class=\"nav-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span>导入配置<!----></button><button class=\"nav-button\"><span class=\"nav-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⇄</span>Agent 接入<!----></button><button class=\"nav-button\"><span class=\"nav-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">≡</span>活动<!----></button><button class=\"nav-button settings-nav\"><span class=\"nav-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⚙</span>设置<!----></button><div class=\"local-note\"><span class=\"status-dot good\"></span>仅在本机运行</div></nav><div class=\"main-shell\"><header class=\"toolbar\"><span class=\"toolbar-title\">MCP 服务</span><div class=\"toolbar-right\"><label class=\"theme-picker\"><span class=\"sr-only\">选择主题</span><select><option value=\"system\">跟随系统</option><option value=\"light\">Light</option><option value=\"dark\">Dark</option></select></label><span class=\"gateway-state\"><span class=\"status-dot good\"></span>网关运行中</span></div></header><!----><!----><!----><div class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"><span>服务配置已保存。连接状态以网关返回结果为准。</span><button class=\"icon-button\" aria-label=\"关闭提示\">×</button></div><main><section class=\"page services-page\"><div class=\"page-head\"><div><h1>MCP 服务</h1><p>所有工具来源，在这里统一管理。</p></div><div class=\"actions\"><button class=\"control\">↓ 导入</button><button class=\"control primary\">＋ 添加服务</button></div></div><label class=\"search-box\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">⌕</span><input aria-label=\"搜索 MCP 服务\" placeholder=\"搜索服务、传输方式或状态\"></label><div class=\"master-detail\"><div class=\"service-list\"><div class=\"list-caption\">1 个服务</div><!----><button class=\"service-row\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span class=\"service-symbol\" aria-hidden=\"true\">N</span><span class=\"grow\"><strong>native-echo</strong><small>stdio · 1 tools</small><span class=\"state-line good\"><span class=\"status-dot\"></span>可用</span></span></button></div><aside class=\"inspector\" aria-label=\"选中服务详情\"><div class=\"inspect-header\"><div class=\"inspect-top\"><div class=\"inspect-name\"><span class=\"service-symbol large\" aria-hidden=\"true\">N</span><div><h2>native-echo</h2><span class=\"badge good\">可用</span></div></div><label class=\"check-row\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"\">启用</label></div><div class=\"meta-line\"><code>/Users/steve/.pyenv/versions/3.12.10/bin/python3</code><span>1 tools</span></div><p class=\"note\">Connected (1 tool)</p></div><div class=\"tab-bar\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"服务详情\"><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">Tools</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\">连接与认证</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">活动</button></div><div class=\"panel-body\" role=\"tabpanel\"><dl class=\"detail-list\"><div><dt>传输方式</dt><dd>stdio</dd></div><div><dt>认证方式</dt><dd>无认证</dd></div><div><dt>认证状态</dt><dd>上游未提供状态</dd></div><!----><!----></dl><div class=\"actions\"><button class=\"control\">测试连接</button><button class=\"control\">重新连接</button><button class=\"control\">编辑配置</button></div><!----><section class=\"form-section\"><h3>移除服务</h3><p class=\"muted\">移除网关中的配置，保留已生成的配置备份。</p><button class=\"control danger\">移除服务</button></section></div></aside></div></section></main><footer class=\"app-footer\"><span>1 / 1 个服务可用</span><span>1 tools<!----></span><span class=\"footer-right\">本机 · macOS</span></footer></div><dialog class=\"dialog\"><!----></dialog><dialog class=\"detail-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"activity-detail-title\"><!----></dialog></div></div>\n</body></html>",
